"NodeText","Data":"性味：味苦、涩，性平。"}]},{"ID":"20240902093536-xr0re2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093536-xr0re2z","updated":"20240902093542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经：归肝、脾、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902093543-zhlywcj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093543-zhlywcj","updated":"20240902093551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功效：收敛止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240902093551-u2ars68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093551-u2ars68","updated":"20240902093556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治：吐血，衄血，便血，尿血，血崩，外伤出血。"}]},{"ID":"20240902093558-zasj83o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093558-zasj83o","updated":"20240902093651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相关配伍："}]},{"ID":"20240902093606-k7opzd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093606-k7opzd2","updated":"20240902093606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、治肠风泻血：棕榈灰二两，熟艾（捣罗成者）一两。上二味用熟鸡子两个，同研得所；别炮附子去皮脐，为末。每服用水一盏，附子末一钱，煎数沸放温，调前药二钱匕，空心食前服。（《圣济总录》棕艾散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902093606-e0xicn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093606-e0xicn5","updated":"20240902093606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、治妇人经血不止：棕榈皮（烧灰）、柏叶（焙）各一两。上二味捣罗为散，酒调下二钱。（《圣济总录》棕榈皮散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902093606-l3q988y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093606-l3q988y","updated":"20240902093606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、治高血压：鲜棕榈皮18g，鲜向日葵花盘60g。水煎服，每日1剂。（《江西草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902093619-zh0n8u8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093619-zh0n8u8","updated":"20240902093622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用注意：出血诸证瘀滞未尽者不宜独用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902093632-h46wyqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093632-h46wyqt","updated":"20240902093652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相关论述："}]},{"ID":"20240902093639-l741etl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093639-l741etl","updated":"20240902093639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、论棕榈皮之临床应用：李时珍：“棕灰性涩，若失血去多，瘀滞已尽者，用之切当，所谓涩可去脱也。与乱发同用更良。年久败棕入药尤妙。”（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902093639-s9gsbcj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093639-s9gsbcj","updated":"20240902093639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、《本草衍义》：“棕榈木，今人旋为器。皮烧为黑灰，治妇人血露及吐血，仍佐之他药。每岁剐取棕皮，不尔束死。”"}]},{"ID":"20240902093623-0sa3jr7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902093623-0sa3jr7"}},{"ID":"20240902093630-9b0afnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902093630-9b0afnn"}}]}